@startuml
title Figure 70 — HS200 Device input timing

clock "CLOCK INPUT" as CLK with period 1

binary "CMD.DAT[7:0] INPUT" as CMD

@0
CLK is high
CMD is low

@0.2
CLK is low

@0.5
CLK is high

@0.7
CLK is low

@1
CLK is high

concise "Voltage Levels" as V

@0
V is "VSS"

@0.3
V is "VIL"

@0.45
V is "VIH"

@0.55
V is "VIH"

@0.7
V is "VIL"

@1
V is "VSS"

highlight 0.45 to 0.55 #LightGreen : VALID\nWINDOW

@enduml